WEBVTT

00:00:00.690 --> 00:00:06.030
<i>Everyone is searching for a new world</i>

00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:12.140
<i>to attain that overflowing dream.</i>

00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:17.710
<i>They all jump over the horizon,</i>

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:26.480
<i>regardless of what lies beyond.</i>

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:34.230
<i>We've run,</i>

00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:36.700
<i>we've dived into hope,</i>

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:39.570
<i>and forgotten only courage.</i>

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:44.300
<i>And we've been swept away by the crowd</i>

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:48.970
<i>only to lose something dear to us.</i>

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:54.650
<i>I smile with a twisted face,</i>

00:00:54.650 --> 00:01:01.310
<i>and it was the best smile I could put on.</i>

00:01:02.590 --> 00:01:04.690
<i>The inside of my mask overflowed with tears</i>

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:12.330
<i>so I covered my wet mask
with yet another mask.</i>

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:17.240
<i>I continue to walk through
the flat battleground,</i>

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:22.470
<i>and I struggle, unable to warp.</i>

00:01:22.470 --> 00:01:32.590
<i>The dream waits quietly on a cape far away.</i>

00:01:32.590 --> 00:01:37.320
<i>Even if I fumble around clumsily,</i>

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:42.060
<i>I'm sure I'll still be
able to make it there.</i>

00:01:46.590 --> 00:01:50.660
<i>You truly are worthy of being
Kiyotaka-sama's younger brother.</i>

00:01:50.660 --> 00:01:52.530
But I win!

00:01:52.530 --> 00:01:55.660
I saw through you and won!

00:02:00.370 --> 00:02:03.670
Now your death has been sealed.

00:02:04.510 --> 00:02:07.210
10 more seconds
and I could've stolen it...

00:02:07.210 --> 00:02:08.980
One minute left.

00:02:10.450 --> 00:02:13.520
I guess I can only pray now...

00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:18.760
I beseech you, O' Lord!
Save this pitiful sinner!

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:20.950
There's no such thing as God.

00:02:22.090 --> 00:02:23.320
Are you so sure?

00:02:25.330 --> 00:02:26.490
Look...

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:29.560
A goddess has arrived!

00:02:38.210 --> 00:02:40.750
My prayer has been heard!

00:02:40.750 --> 00:02:42.270
<i>Narumi-san!</i>

00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:53.850
Hallelujah!

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:03.000
Disarm successful!

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:09.270
Welcome back.

00:03:09.270 --> 00:03:11.940
<i>Why hello there, Asazuki-san.</i>

00:03:11.940 --> 00:03:14.670
<i>Narumi-san won!</i>

00:03:15.510 --> 00:03:19.350
My brother would've won
much more stylishly,

00:03:19.350 --> 00:03:21.380
but this was my all.

00:03:23.420 --> 00:03:29.190
I'm never doing this
sort of thing again...

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:34.490
"Goodnight, Sweetheart"

00:03:44.710 --> 00:03:46.170
Say.

00:03:46.170 --> 00:03:50.210
If Little Narumi knew
I was at Shumari Station,

00:03:50.210 --> 00:03:54.220
wouldn't he have told you to
get off at the next station?

00:03:54.220 --> 00:03:55.980
<i>He did tell me.</i>

00:03:55.980 --> 00:03:57.550
But the conclusion has been reached.

00:03:57.550 --> 00:04:00.150
You wouldn't capture me now, would you?

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:02.820
Heh, I wouldn't be so sure.

00:04:02.820 --> 00:04:04.990
I'm a sore loser,

00:04:04.990 --> 00:04:08.800
and as you know,
I don't keep my promises.

00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:11.290
<i>But Rio-san isn't that way.</i>

00:04:13.700 --> 00:04:15.500
Yeah.

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:19.630
If Rio accepted defeat,
then I'll do the same.

00:04:30.420 --> 00:04:32.720
<i>I lost...</i>

00:04:32.720 --> 00:04:35.020
<i>I completely lost...</i>

00:04:35.990 --> 00:04:37.990
Don't look so down.

00:04:37.990 --> 00:04:41.460
You're the one with better skill.

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:45.330
I can't bet my life on my
resoluteness or my pride,

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:49.200
and I barely even believe
in my own ability.

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:51.310
I'm a coward who runs for a safe place

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:54.880
whenever given the
opportunity to escape.

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:58.210
Truthfully, I can't stop
shaking even now.

00:04:58.210 --> 00:05:00.680
I don't even have the
strength to stand up.

00:05:00.680 --> 00:05:02.220
I'm pathetic...

00:05:02.220 --> 00:05:04.090
What...

00:05:04.090 --> 00:05:06.690
What are you talking about?!

00:05:06.690 --> 00:05:10.990
Why can't you believe
in your abilities?

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:14.690
Why are you sitting down on the ground?!

00:05:18.470 --> 00:05:22.900
You should be sticking
your chest out!

00:05:22.900 --> 00:05:25.640
You should be standing even taller!

00:05:25.640 --> 00:05:29.540
You won! Believe in your ability!

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:37.420
The only reason I'm alive

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:40.750
is because you didn't
fight your hardest.

00:05:42.590 --> 00:05:46.890
My complete loss to you the
other day is proof of this.

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:51.970
That day, you correctly judged
me as a pathetic person.

00:05:51.970 --> 00:05:54.160
You even read through me and won.

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:58.940
I haven't grown at all since then.

00:05:58.940 --> 00:06:02.680
Yet the reason you misread me this time

00:06:02.680 --> 00:06:05.910
was because you mistook
me for my brother.

00:06:05.910 --> 00:06:10.120
This confused you and made
you unable to read me.

00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:12.550
That wouldn't have happened
if you had thought normally.

00:06:12.550 --> 00:06:14.460
Little Narumi...

00:06:14.460 --> 00:06:16.660
In terms of actual skill, I lost.

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:18.560
I was just lucky.

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:20.490
That's not true...

00:06:20.490 --> 00:06:22.960
I know myself well enough to know.

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:26.570
I always run around
doing things randomly,

00:06:26.570 --> 00:06:29.470
never thinking about the consequences.

00:06:29.470 --> 00:06:32.240
<i>Only after I've done things
do I think hard</i>

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:34.430
and make sense out of them.

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:39.010
It's not luck.

00:06:39.010 --> 00:06:43.480
It was your skill that confused me!

00:06:43.480 --> 00:06:47.690
You smiled calmly and remained
quiet until the very end,

00:06:47.690 --> 00:06:50.660
<i>just like Kiyotaka-sama would.</i>

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:53.090
Despite feeling enough
terror to cause shaking,

00:06:53.090 --> 00:06:56.860
you suppressed it inside
yourself so I wouldn't see it.

00:06:56.860 --> 00:06:59.560
Please don't deny that courage!

00:07:04.210 --> 00:07:08.470
My brother wouldn't tremble like me...

00:07:11.880 --> 00:07:17.790
<i>If anyone can go where
Kiyotaka-sama couldn't, it's him...</i>

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:21.920
<i>Our fate may change after all...</i>

00:07:30.330 --> 00:07:31.770
Hey!

00:07:31.770 --> 00:07:33.430
What are you doing?!

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:35.370
Hey, get off!

00:07:41.780 --> 00:07:46.210
<i>Oh yeah! She's still
supposed to be in bed!</i>

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:49.450
Are you alright?! Hey, say something!

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:54.190
<i>W-what are you doing, Narumi-san?!</i>

00:07:54.190 --> 00:07:57.860
I'm worrying myself to death and
here I find you playing with a girl!

00:07:57.860 --> 00:07:58.990
Don't misunderstand!

00:07:58.990 --> 00:08:00.820
Just call an ambulance!

00:08:01.860 --> 00:08:03.060
An ambulance?

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:05.090
Her wounds are completely open!

00:08:05.870 --> 00:08:06.920
Rio!

00:08:15.380 --> 00:08:16.670
"Rio Takeuchi"

00:08:24.490 --> 00:08:26.080
Little Narumi...

00:08:27.120 --> 00:08:31.180
Even if the police catch Rio,
she won't say anything.

00:08:33.090 --> 00:08:36.330
In her eyes, battles are sacred.

00:08:36.330 --> 00:08:37.630
Because she's lost to you,

00:08:37.630 --> 00:08:39.770
she'll probably let
herself be caught quietly

00:08:39.770 --> 00:08:42.540
and will probably admit
to killing Imazato too.

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:43.700
But...

00:08:43.700 --> 00:08:44.810
But what?

00:08:44.810 --> 00:08:47.710
I doubt she'll say anything
about the Blade Children,

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:50.340
which is what you want
to know about the most...

00:08:52.180 --> 00:08:55.180
There's only one thing I want to know.

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:59.410
Tell where my brother...
where Kiyotaka Narumi is.

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:03.620
Sorry, but I don't know.

00:09:05.730 --> 00:09:07.090
It's the truth.

00:09:07.090 --> 00:09:10.260
We can't even contact him ourselves.

00:09:10.260 --> 00:09:16.430
Not even we know what Kiyotaka is
trying to do with us Blade Children.

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:20.570
Is that all you want to ask?

00:09:20.570 --> 00:09:22.410
Yeah...

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:24.780
Where are you going?!

00:09:24.780 --> 00:09:27.800
You gave us quite a bit of fun!

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:32.220
But unlike Rio,
I'm not good with people.

00:09:32.220 --> 00:09:35.690
Being captured quietly
just isn't my thing.

00:09:35.690 --> 00:09:37.690
And besides, they probably
can't take me into custody

00:09:37.690 --> 00:09:39.530
with that tape anyway...

00:09:39.530 --> 00:09:40.760
Go.

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:44.530
The next time we meet,
I swear I'll catch you.

00:09:49.670 --> 00:09:51.900
<i>What are you doing here?!</i>

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:57.370
Eyes Rutherford?!

00:10:07.690 --> 00:10:09.180
Rutherford...

00:10:14.030 --> 00:10:16.260
I see...

00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:19.360
So Rio lost to Little Narumi...

00:10:20.730 --> 00:10:22.440
You too?!

00:10:22.440 --> 00:10:24.340
Yes...

00:10:24.340 --> 00:10:27.470
I, too, am one of the Blade Children.

00:10:47.230 --> 00:10:50.030
The Blade Children?

00:10:52.700 --> 00:10:54.500
Little Narumi...

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:56.160
Leave now.

00:10:56.840 --> 00:10:59.070
I will not hand Rio over to the police.

00:10:59.070 --> 00:11:01.640
-What?!
-You have no say in this!

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:03.040
If you leave,

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:09.040
I promise to never bring harm to
you or that strong-spirited girl.

00:11:10.990 --> 00:11:12.650
Oh, yes.

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:16.090
You may take the tape
with you as insurance.

00:11:16.090 --> 00:11:18.890
Alright, I've had enough of this!
Don't insult me!

00:11:18.890 --> 00:11:22.200
Listen! Her crime has been proven!

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:25.530
With this, I can drive you
guys into the corner too!

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:28.630
I refuse to accept your deal!

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:32.970
If you refuse to give up Rio,

00:11:32.970 --> 00:11:37.410
then the police will find out the
relationship between Kiyotaka and us.

00:11:37.410 --> 00:11:39.280
What's wrong with that?

00:11:39.280 --> 00:11:41.580
You wouldn't care if they found out

00:11:41.580 --> 00:11:46.290
that he was an accomplice
of us criminals?

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:47.220
<i>Narumi-san!</i>

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:49.690
The police will catch your brother
too if you're not careful!

00:11:49.690 --> 00:11:51.690
I don't care.

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:53.260
<i>Narumi-san?</i>

00:11:53.260 --> 00:11:57.670
It'd be best if the entire
world was against him.

00:11:57.670 --> 00:12:01.470
It'd be a lot easier to find
him if he was a wanted man.

00:12:01.470 --> 00:12:03.340
<i>Even if you don't care,</i>

00:12:03.340 --> 00:12:06.330
isn't there still someone
who would suffer?

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:12.480
<i>He's right...</i>

00:12:12.480 --> 00:12:15.150
<i>If my brother wound up
being on the run,</i>

00:12:15.150 --> 00:12:16.240
<i>then Madoka would...</i>

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:22.360
If you leave,
I swear to keep my promise.

00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:31.730
Then we have a deal.

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:33.170
I have no other choice.

00:12:34.030 --> 00:12:37.440
What are you thinking?

00:12:38.370 --> 00:12:41.540
<i>What am I to you guys?!</i>

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:46.210
It is not yet the
time to discuss that...

00:12:46.210 --> 00:12:47.740
Someday you will know.

00:12:51.890 --> 00:12:53.890
Little Narumi...

00:12:53.890 --> 00:12:58.190
Believe in your abilities...

00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:12.660
<i>Narumi-san!</i>

00:13:14.340 --> 00:13:16.980
Watch where you're going!

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:20.000
Sorry, I'll make him
be careful from now on!

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:27.490
<i>What in the world am
I being tested for?</i>

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:29.690
<i>What are they...</i>

00:13:29.690 --> 00:13:31.750
<i>What is my brother... thinking?!</i>

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:34.390
<i>"Little Narumi...</i>

00:13:34.390 --> 00:13:38.630
<i>Believe in your abilities..."</i>

00:13:40.730 --> 00:13:42.130
<i>Narumi-san!</i>

00:13:44.270 --> 00:13:45.210
What?

00:13:45.210 --> 00:13:48.570
Believe in your abilities more!

00:13:49.380 --> 00:13:51.900
<i>I agree with Rio-san!</i>

00:13:58.220 --> 00:14:02.250
Do you think this deal will
actually make Rio happy?

00:14:02.890 --> 00:14:04.150
No.

00:14:05.890 --> 00:14:08.160
Then why did you say that?!

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:10.560
This is a question of
Rio's pride, you know!

00:14:14.900 --> 00:14:16.530
Say something!

00:14:23.140 --> 00:14:26.410
Ugh. You never say anything, do you!

00:14:27.210 --> 00:14:31.080
We cannot afford to lose
Rio's abilities now...

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:33.420
Did something happen?

00:14:33.420 --> 00:14:37.220
A change in the situation around us.

00:14:38.030 --> 00:14:42.800
Even more dangerous Hunters
will shortly appear.

00:14:42.800 --> 00:14:44.000
Kanone?

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:46.100
Kanone came to tell you that?!

00:14:46.100 --> 00:14:49.670
We must make our
preparations immediately

00:14:49.670 --> 00:14:53.040
before all the Blade Children
are hunted down.

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:55.780
Even more dangerous Hunters?!

00:14:55.780 --> 00:14:58.610
I knew this day would come!

00:14:58.610 --> 00:14:59.550
Rutherford!

00:14:59.550 --> 00:15:01.610
Did you come to tell us that?

00:15:04.820 --> 00:15:06.290
A melon?!

00:15:06.290 --> 00:15:10.060
I forgot to give it
to her the other day.

00:15:10.060 --> 00:15:12.620
I thought maybe she might be angry...

00:15:13.630 --> 00:15:16.600
You make no sense at all, you know that?

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:25.040
Outside the window,
kira kira kira ri

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:31.080
A shooting star streaks

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:37.020
The moon,
yura yura yura ri

00:15:37.020 --> 00:15:43.020
naps in the ocean of stars

00:15:43.020 --> 00:15:48.960
Someone waved a magic wand

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:54.200
-The magic of love,
a dream-colored time

00:15:54.200 --> 00:16:01.140
-Come on, let's go home.
-The magic of love,
a dream-colored time

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:06.950
The shooting star,
kira kira kira ri

00:16:06.950 --> 00:16:12.720
Became a crystal drop

00:16:12.720 --> 00:16:13.890
What a weird song.

00:16:13.890 --> 00:16:15.220
Part two!

00:16:15.220 --> 00:16:21.090
In the blue sky,
puka puka puka ri

00:16:21.090 --> 00:16:26.570
vapor trails
and cotton candy clouds

00:16:26.570 --> 00:16:27.930
Weird song.

00:16:35.480 --> 00:16:36.460
Um...

00:16:37.340 --> 00:16:40.010
<i>You weren't able to catch
Rio-san this time,</i>

00:16:40.010 --> 00:16:42.750
but you still won, you know!

00:16:42.750 --> 00:16:44.950
My safety has been guaranteed,

00:16:44.950 --> 00:16:48.410
and you proved once again
just how amazing you are!

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:56.430
So why is it that
you can't be happy?

00:16:57.200 --> 00:17:02.300
Maybe you feel bad for how
unfortunate those people are?

00:17:02.300 --> 00:17:07.940
Rio did take drastic steps just
to protect her friends' lives...

00:17:07.940 --> 00:17:11.450
That must be what
you're thinking, right?

00:17:11.450 --> 00:17:12.310
Hey.

00:17:12.310 --> 00:17:13.750
Yes?

00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:15.610
Shut up.

00:17:17.250 --> 00:17:20.550
You don't talk to someone like
that when they're worried about you!

00:17:20.550 --> 00:17:23.560
You seemed glum so I thought
I would try to cheer you up,

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:25.080
<i>but no!</i>

00:17:26.760 --> 00:17:29.500
I'm dead-tired and exhausted!

00:17:29.500 --> 00:17:31.530
Lend me your shoulder!

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:32.760
Huh?

00:17:35.540 --> 00:17:36.240
Um!

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:39.570
I haven't slept much since
the day before yesterday.

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:41.840
Let me sleep for a bit...

00:17:49.320 --> 00:17:52.250
Look at how he's sleeping on her!

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:53.780
I bet they do it!

00:18:01.090 --> 00:18:04.220
<i>You did really well, Narumi-san...</i>

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:22.750
The Blade Children...

00:18:22.750 --> 00:18:25.450
She was always scared of something

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:28.620
and would mutter how
she was a cursed child...

00:18:29.560 --> 00:18:33.320
Does she really have
that terrible of a past?

00:18:36.730 --> 00:18:40.430
The cursed children must be killed...

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:42.490
The Blade Children...

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:46.300
<i>Why are their lives being targeted?</i>

00:18:47.170 --> 00:18:49.770
<i>Did something happen in their pasts?</i>

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:53.910
<i>Tell me...Kiyotaka-san...</i>

00:18:55.420 --> 00:18:57.380
<i>Where are you?</i>

00:19:06.430 --> 00:19:09.490
She's late again today...

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:28.010
Little Narumi...

00:19:28.010 --> 00:19:31.810
Believe in your abilities...

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:35.990
<i>What is being expected of me?</i>

00:19:35.990 --> 00:19:39.330
It is not yet the time to discuss that...

00:19:39.330 --> 00:19:41.390
Someday you will know.

00:19:41.390 --> 00:19:45.900
If you leave,
I swear to keep my promise.

00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:47.200
Damn it!

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:50.660
<i>Am I following in my brother's
footsteps yet again?</i>

00:19:51.910 --> 00:19:56.500
<i>Am I being dragged into the darkness
that my brother headed for?</i>

00:20:03.650 --> 00:20:09.250
<i>Kiyotaka said that the power
to believe can change fate...</i>

00:20:10.920 --> 00:20:14.550
<i>Is he telling me to believe
in Little Narumi?</i>

00:20:16.600 --> 00:20:21.160
<i>But there is no longer anyone...</i>

00:20:33.350 --> 00:20:37.110
<i>That I can believe in.</i>

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:57.890
<i>Eyes...</i>

00:20:59.510 --> 00:21:03.770
<i>Come with me...</i>

00:21:05.940 --> 00:21:11.640
<i>A sweet scent washes into my throat</i>

00:21:11.640 --> 00:21:18.350
<i>and my feelings continuously overflow...</i>

00:21:30.460 --> 00:21:36.500
<i>Don't look at me with that same gaze</i>

00:21:36.500 --> 00:21:42.140
<i>that's like you're following a soccer ball.</i>

00:21:42.140 --> 00:21:48.050
<i>I've already grown used to
my third year at the office,</i>

00:21:48.050 --> 00:21:54.620
<i>but did I lose something instead?</i>

00:21:54.620 --> 00:22:00.360
<i>Those days long ago when we
would talk about anything...</i>

00:22:00.360 --> 00:22:05.570
<i>We're finally old enough now</i>

00:22:05.570 --> 00:22:11.400
<i>to have those slightly awkward
discussions about love.</i>

00:22:11.400 --> 00:22:23.020
<i>A single day seems so long,
but a whole year ends so quickly.</i>

00:22:23.020 --> 00:22:28.790
<i>A whole year seems so short,</i>

00:22:28.790 --> 00:22:35.090
<i>but how well will I be able
to live the rest of my life?</i>

00:22:39.360 --> 00:22:41.600
Time for Hiyono's Useful News Report!

00:22:41.600 --> 00:22:43.700
Water striders glide lightly!

00:22:43.700 --> 00:22:45.800
Come down, rain!

00:22:45.800 --> 00:22:48.570
<i>Next episode's highlight
is Hiyono-chan,</i>

00:22:48.570 --> 00:22:51.970
who dreams for love and prays for rain!

00:22:51.970 --> 00:22:53.240
<i>Going home after school
is called "geko",</i>

00:22:53.240 --> 00:22:55.180
<i>and the sound a frog
makes is "geko-geko"!</i>

00:22:55.180 --> 00:22:57.410
On the next Spiral:
Bond of Reasoning...

00:22:57.410 --> 00:22:58.750
Dry Eyes

00:22:58.750 --> 00:23:00.980
The reason people are
sentimental on rainy days

00:23:00.980 --> 00:23:03.750
is because the sky is crying!

00:23:03.750 --> 00:23:06.050
That's all for today's
Hiyono's Playhouse!
